      "title": "wslog: Clean up timestamp code",
      "message": "wslog: Clean up timestamp code\n\nMove the timestamp clock code to wslog.c.\n\nIgnore gettimeofday(). Do not print the subsecond time value\nif using time(). Make the value negative in that case.\n",
      "author_name": "João Valverde",
      "author_email": "j@v6e.pt",
